  "label": "Academic stress minimization",
  "description": "The meme's core joke relies on the concept of trivializing or minimizing the emotional weight of academic stress, particularly the stress associated with college admissions. It uses the children's expressions as a humorous contrast to suggest that their perceived sadness is insignificant compared to the real-world stress of college rejection, which can be a deeply personal and emotionally charged experience.",
